ess they are accompanied by the public directive."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"max-age"},{"type":"text","text":" directive is sent by a server to indicate that the HTTP response will remain fresh for a specified number of seconds after it is generated."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Essentially, it informs caches how long it will remain fresh. Importantly, the number of seconds indicates the period from which the content was generated,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as opposed to received. This means that any time spent in transit or stored in the caches of intermediaries is deducted from the allowance."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"immutable"},{"text":" directive indicates a guarantee by the server that the HTTP response will not be updated while it is still fresh.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This can be used to avoid unnecessary conditional HTTP requests","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://VernissageServer/SE":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Encodable","identifier":"doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/SE"},"doc://VernissageServer/documentation/VernissageServer":{"title":"Vernissage","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/vernissageserver","type":"topic","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer","abstract":[{"text":"Vernissage is a photo-sharing platform built for photographers, designed to seamlessly exchange content across","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the fediverse - offering powerful features you won’t find anywhere else.","type":"text"}]},"doc://VernissageServer/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/s8SendableP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://VernissageServer/documentation/VernissageServer/BusinessCardField":{"